d Total GDP are the values you have.</li><li><strong>Actual increase in GDP</strong> = <code>Spending × Spending multiplier</code> — the form to use when Spending and Spending multiplier are the values you have.</li></ul><p>Any one of Spending multiplier, Marginal propensity to save (MPS) and Marginal propensity to consume (MPC) can be left empty: the page checks which box is blank and rearranges the relationship for it, which is why it converts as well as it calculates.</p>
